# 詞: 睇怕

1. 佢咁傻，仲敢喺街頭睇怕人，真係冒死。 (He's so stupid that he dares to stare down people on the street. He's really asking for trouble.)
2. 我唔會睇怕佢，我知佢冇幾多本事。 (I won't stare him down. I know he's not that capable.)
3. 你咁睇怕我，我咁睇怕你，最後大家都唔會得。 (You stare me down, I stare you down, in the end nobody wins.)
4. 佢喺網上睇怕人，真係無知。 (He stares people down online. He's really ignorant.)
5. 唔好睇怕人嘅眼，會令人覺得你好攻。 (Don't stare people in the eye. It makes people think you're aggressive.)
6. 佢一睇怕我，我就冇心情講話。 (The moment he stares me down, I don't feel like talking.)
7. 喺呢度睇怕人唔會得，多數都係自己吃虧。 (Staring people down here doesn't work. Most of the time you just end up hurting yourself.)
8. 佢睇怕我嘅時候，我都好唔舒服。 (When he stares me down, I feel very uncomfortable.)
9. 你睇怕我咁耐，我都唔會承認你講嘅話。 (You stare me down for so long, I still won't admit what you say.)
10. 唔好因為講嘢唔同就睇怕人，好似你係老大。 (Don't stare people down just because you disagree with them, as if you're the boss.) [end of text]


